{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"8599b7763963d7f6cf470cb70d2655909d3e69fdfc58e82c3bc2246f0142ece5","digest":{"component_or_area":"reconciler read/check paths and backend composition","key_entities":["src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/runtime.py","src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/_backend_registry.py","ReconcilerSettings","GitRuntime","BridgeRuntime","load_config()","reconcile-check","SecretStr","SecretBytes","tests/interfaces/store/test_reconciler_operation_bindings.py"],"problem_keywords":["reconciler","read path","immutable settings","ambient config reload","backend composition","operation runtime","static configuration"],"propositions":["Reconciler read/check paths currently call load_config() and inspect environment/cwd, allowing ambient mutations to change read scope or discard supplied registry config during operation execution.","Backend composition must be cut over to consume focused immutable ReconcilerSettings and runtime projections composed from S1 snapshot, with exactly one selected Jira Cloud or Data Center backend constructed and stable for the operation.","All read/check call paths (preflight, access check, fetch, paging, diff, mapper, sanitizer, tracker reads) must thread the same backend/runtime and remove ambient reloads to ensure supplied config remains authoritative.","Static authentication fields in the reconciler runtime carrier must use non-serializable Pydantic SecretStr/SecretBytes, excluded from repr/equality/hash/cache/fingerprint, and unwrap only in the selected Jira sending adapter.","Missing/conflicting auth, empty project/query scope, or malformed config must fail before any Jira model request or local write, with no anonymous/cross-provider fallback behavior."]},"digest_ha